/*
 * STM32CubeMX 6.17 / STM32CubeH7 1.11.1 MDK project compatibility stub.
 *
 * CubeMX adds this translation unit even with ENABLE_MPU disabled, but the
 * selected firmware package does not copy the corresponding source file.
 * With configENABLE_MPU == 0, the FreeRTOS kernel does not require MPU
 * wrapper implementations.  Keep this file so regenerated MDK projects have
 * a valid source path.  Do not enable MPU without replacing this stub with
 * the matching FreeRTOS MPU wrapper source.
 */
